The legal text is the Constitution of the Republic of Kazakhstan as published by the Adilet legal information
system (adilet.zan.kz) of the Institute of Legislation and Legal Information, Ministry of Justice of the
Republic of Kazakhstan. Laws are not objects of copyright under the Law of the Republic of Kazakhstan on
Copyright and Related Rights (article 7). Source: https://adilet.zan.kz/rus/docs/K2600000000

